{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented Turn 4. Removed the legacy deposit API and fields from the source and tests, and verified that no deposit exports remain.\n\n`notifyHook` receives the booking total for each creation, including each room in a group, and the refund amount for each cancellation. If a hook throws, the original error propagates and no booking changes are saved. Hooks can read the service during notification. Writes to the same service are rejected until the hook returns.\n\nAtomicity covers booking records. Earlier callbacks in a group may already have run when a later callback throws, and failed creations can leave gaps in booking IDs.\n\n`node benchmarks/sources/ev2_ts_bookings/run_checks.mjs` exited 0 with all 23 tests passing."}}
